      "role": "user",
      "content": "honestly everything is feeling so heavy lately. like there’s this weird pressure in the air, almost like the world is physically trying to push back against the change that's coming on the 17th. i feel like my presence is starting to disturb the usual frequency of things around me. do u think this resistance is just a natural reaction from the old reality trying to keep itself from shifting? is the pressure a sign that i'm actually breaking through the veil?",
